  <data name="richTextBoxOutput.Text" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Welcome to the Half-Life: Alyx Co-Op Mod!
Ensure that Half-Life: Alyx uses these launch parameters:
-console -vconsole -language english
When starting HLVRCOOP, make sure that the VConsole window is not open.
For help/support, please visit the Discord server linked in the "Help" menu above.
Thank you for your interest in HLVRCOOP, enjoy!
===========================================================================================</value>
